A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the puzzle game known as '''Sengoku Puzzle!! Animal Great Battle''' (戦国パズル あにまる大合戦, ''Sengoku Pazuru Animaru Daigassen'') was held from December 15, 2017 to January 15th, 2018.<br>
The game is published by [[wikipedia:Racjin|Racjin]].

