==Event==
*'''Collaboration Fixed Stages'''
The special stage "''Cat Appears!!''" (ネコ登場!!, ''Neko Tōjō!!'') will be available throughout the collaboration period. Clearing this stage rewards the player with a 4★ [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]].

*'''Collaboration Gacha'''
From December 21, 2017 to December 27, 2017 the first part of the collaboration gacha banner will be available. In it, [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] appear as 4★ characters, with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] being 5★. From January 9, 2018 to January 15, 2018 the second part will be available. It swaps Tank and Gross Cat with [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]] and [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Sumo Cat]] respectively, while keeping Bahamut as is.

==Appears==
